<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0AA114010"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "2" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "1" valign = "middle">
<ptxt>
Speed Control Lamp Control Circuit
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "3" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "1" valign = "middle">
<ptxt>
“CRUISE / SET indicator lighting signal” from combination meter remains unchanged even if ECM transmits request to turn on or turn off “CRUISE / SET indicator light control signal” to combination meter through CAN communication.
</ptxt>
</entry>
